===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|[ˈfɪndn̩]|[ˈfɪndən]}}
* {{rhymes|de|ɪndn̩}}
* {{audio|de|De-finden.ogg|audio (Germany)}}
* {{audio|de|De-at-finden.ogg|audio (Austria)}}

===Verb===
{{de-verb|finden<fand,gefunden,fände>}}

# {{lb|de|transitive}} to [[find]]; to [[discover]]
